geanyprogress — AI agent plan progress panel for Geany

Shows a numbered list of plan phases with completion status in the sidebar.
Receives JSON updates over a Unix domain socket ($GEANY_PROGRESS_SOCK).

API:
  {"plan":"Plan Name","phases":["Phase 1","Phase 2"]}   — register plan
  {"phase":1,"status":"complete"}                        — mark phase done

Helper script:
  geany-progress init "Plan Name" "Phase 1" "Phase 2"
  geany-progress done 1
  geany-progress status
